        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 1055, Lavatory Inswinging Door Stop and Keeper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on commercial restroom 3/4\" thick inswinging doors with a 3/4\" thick jamb. Stall door must use hinges (not a pivot). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe keeper is designed for use with <a href=\"/products/restroom-door-rim-bolt-and-keeper-bommer-15004\"><b>Bommer 15004 Door Bolt</b></a> (door bolt sold separately and is not required).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/lavatory-outswinging-door-stop-bommer-1057\"><b>Bommer 1057 Restroom Outswinging Door Stop</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClamp flange jamb bracket mounted with the included thru-bolts and nuts.  Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer 1055-D750-J750  Restroom Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Brass</li> \r\n<li>Height: 2.500\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: .750\"</li>\r\n<li>Jamb Thickness: .750\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber bumper on stop</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1055.pdf?v=1691094996\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 1055 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
